# Least-privilege Mosquitto ACL for one Unchair Mac (issue #19).
# Replace uch_d19add06 with the Device ID from Unchair Settings.
#
# Pair with a dedicated MQTT user (not your HA admin account).
# Install as the Mosquitto add-on ACL file or mosquitto `acl_file`.
#
# Pattern: that user may only touch unchair/<device_id>/#
# Never grant `#` admin rights to the Unchair client.

user unchair
topic readwrite unchair/uch_d19add06/#
topic read homeassistant/#

# Home Assistant's own MQTT user still needs broader rights to ingest
# discovery + state; keep that on the HA integration credentials, not on Unchair.
